Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:36.26,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Billie, if you stand over here, and if you hold that trophy up,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比利 请站这边 请举起奖杯
