Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:42.36,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let's hear it for Mirra Andreeva!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为米拉 安德烈耶娃欢呼吧！
